#: plugins/mqtt/src/plugin.vala:1337
msgid ""
"ℹ Server: ejabberd (mod_mqtt detected)\n"
"\n"
"ejabberd shares XMPP and MQTT authentication.\n"
"You can use your XMPP credentials to connect\n"
"to the MQTT broker on the same domain.\n"
"\n"
"Per-account mode uses these credentials automatically."
msgstr ""
"ℹ Server: ejabberd (mod_mqtt terdeteksi)\n"
"\n"
"ejabberd menggunakan autentikasi yang sama untuk XMPP dan MQTT.\n"
"Anda dapat menggunakan kredensial XMPP untuk terhubung\n"
"ke broker MQTT pada domain yang sama.\n"
"\n"
"Mode per akun menggunakan kredensial ini secara otomatis."

#: plugins/mqtt/src/plugin.vala:1345
msgid ""
"⚠ Server: Prosody (mod_pubsub_mqtt detected)\n"
"\n"
"Prosody's MQTT bridge does NOT support authentication.\n"
"Any client on the network can subscribe to topics.\n"
"\n"
"Recommendations:\n"
"• Restrict MQTT port via firewall\n"
"• Use TLS for encryption\n"
"• Do not publish sensitive data\n"
"\n"
"Topic format: <HOST>/<TYPE>/<NODE>"
msgstr ""
"⚠ Server: Prosody (mod_pubsub_mqtt terdeteksi)\n"
"\n"
"Bridge MQTT Prosody TIDAK mendukung autentikasi.\n"
"Semua klien dalam jaringan dapat berlangganan topik.\n"
"\n"
"Saran:\n"
"• Batasi port MQTT melalui firewall\n"
"• Gunakan TLS untuk enkripsi\n"
"• Jangan publikasikan data sensitif\n"
"\n"
"Format topik: <HOST>/<TYPE>/<NODE>"

